# Tutorial "Getting Around": two moves by the keys (an arrow browses the
# legal targets, Enter goes), the lesson completes, the crew finish the
# station's tasks and the results open; then the "Work of the Crew" lesson's
# task from the action drawer.
until 600 Hidden Council
frames 30
click =▶ Play
until 120 Choose Your Session
frames 10
click =Tutorial
until 120 Tutorial Lessons
frames 10
save tutorials
click =Getting Around
until 300 Actions ▸
frames 200
click =☰ Log
frames 10
expect Rooms are joined by brass corridors
save lesson
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
expect Target:
key Enter 1
frames 30
expect Good. Move once more
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 30
expect Lesson complete
until 3000 The Station Turns Again
frames 30
click =← Title
until 300 Hidden Council
frames 10
click =▶ Play
until 120 Choose Your Session
frames 10
click =Tutorial
until 120 ✓ Getting Around
frames 10
click =Work of the Crew
until 300 Actions ▸
frames 200
click =Actions ▸
until 600 Do:
frames 10
save lesson-task
click Do:
frames 30
expect Task complete
until 3000 The Station Turns Again
